For background, see the [surreal number overview](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Surreal_number), [nonstandard analysis](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nonstandard_analysis), and [tropical geometry](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_geometry). These links provide context; all definitions and results needed for the demonstrations are given above.

